<title>USA: San Jose $106 mln agency bonds won by Merrill.</title>
<headline>San Jose $106 mln agency bonds won by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. said Tuesday it won $106 million Redevelopment Agency of the City of San Jose, Calif., tax allocation bonds at a true interest cost of 5.62 percent.</p>
</text>
